{"id": "1550606029929189559", "channel_id": "1545385622317965442", "author_id": "231543819026300928", "author_name": "crowlov1", "content": "Additionally. I never liked number inflation in any game.\n\nI liked how arc 1 was low numbers even before it's nerfs.\n\nKinda what I liked about Slay the spire 1 and 2, Darkest dungeon etc.\n\nWhen I stare at a skill with scaling of 5000% atk it starts to be comical", "timestamp": "2026-09-18T20:34:46.402000+00:00", "type": 19, "thread_id": "1545385622317965442", "edited_timestamp": "2026-09-18T20:35:08.599000+00:00", "mentions": ["107013874678521856"], "reply_to": "1550525716846608456", "thread_title": "On the D-Effect Zone Adjustments", "forum_channel_id": "1184003940082262069"}
