{"id": "1550631398837059736", "channel_id": "1545385622317965442", "author_id": "1235297971168608362", "author_name": "forsakenbinary01", "content": "I would agree on battles becoming more rigid and obnoxiously long, but I would disagree on removing turn rewind.\n\nSince turn rewind was working okay in the old dtide. This means the most pressing issue in the current dtide isn't turn rewind. If anything, this feature avoids dragging the battle, because players wouldn't have to redo the whole exploration again.", "timestamp": "2026-09-18T22:15:34.821000+00:00", "type": 19, "thread_id": "1545385622317965442", "mentions": ["107013874678521856"], "reply_to": "1550525716846608456", "thread_title": "On the D-Effect Zone Adjustments", "forum_channel_id": "1184003940082262069"}
