{"id": "1550640949518925825", "channel_id": "1545385622317965442", "author_id": "107013874678521856", "author_name": ".stuffe", "content": "While turn rewind might not have been perceived as a problem before. We have substantially more random effects now than just a few months ago with the new chaos realm, (and Caraboo gifts) \n\nMaybe not as big of a problem, but I certainly wouldn't want to see content getting balanced around it. I would love to see someone test which is better in general: e3 gLotan team with turn rewind or OE gLotan without.", "timestamp": "2026-09-18T22:53:31.881000+00:00", "thread_id": "1545385622317965442", "thread_title": "On the D-Effect Zone Adjustments", "forum_channel_id": "1184003940082262069"}
